; TITHE - title theme, option 1: THE PROCESSION
;
; A march in E minor at 91 BPM - a 16th is one row of THREE ticks, 164.8 ms.
; The horn carries it on its own, which is the speaker's whole arm: an intro
; call, a theme (A) that rises from E and falls back, and a lifted middle (B)
; on C and G that turns on B major to hand back to E. A B A B for ever after
; the intro. Tabor and snare in a dotted march; strings under it.

song procession "The Procession"
groove 3
unit 16
rows 32
measure 16
voice lead horn
voice bass bass
voice chord strings

; --- the call -----------------------------------------------------------------
lead LI1 = o4 l8 e4 r <b> e g b4 | >e4.< b g4 e4 |
lead LI2 = o4 l8 e4 r <b> e g a4 | b2 a g f+4 |
bass BI1 = o2 e1 | e1 |
bass BI2 = o2 e1 | b2 b4 f+4 |
chord CI1 = o3 r1 | [e b]1 |
chord CI2 = o3 [e g b]1 | [d+ f+ b]1 |
drum DI1 = t4 r4 t4 r4 | t4 r4 t4 t8 t8 |
drum DI2 = t4 r4 t4 r4 | t8 t8 t8 t8 T8 T8 T8 T8 |

; --- A: the theme -------------------------------------------------------------
lead LA1 = o4 l8 e4. f+ g4 b4 | >c4.< b a4 g4 |
lead LA2 = o4 l8 f+4 a4 >d4. c< | b2 a g f+4 |
lead LA3 = o4 l8 e4. f+ g4 b4 | >e4. d c4< b4 |
lead LA4 = o4 l8 a4 >c4< b4. a | g f+ e2. |
bass BA1 = o2 l4 e b e b | c g c g |
bass BA2 = o2 l4 d a d a | e b g f+ |
bass BA4 = o2 l4 a e b f+ | e b e2 |
chord CA1 = o3 [e g b]1 | [e g >c]1 |
chord CA2 = o3 [d f+ a]1 | [e g b]1 |
chord CA4 = o3 [e a >c]2 [d+ f+ b]2 | [e g b]1 |
drum DA = k4 s8. s16 k4 s16 s16 s8 | k4 s8. s16 k4 s16 s16 s8 |
drum DA4 = k4 s8. s16 k4 s16 s16 s8 | s8 s8 s8 s16 s16 k4 T8 t8 |

; --- B: the lift --------------------------------------------------------------
lead LB1 = o5 l8 e2 d4 c4 | d4.< b g2 |
lead LB2 = o4 l8 a4 b >c d4< a4 | b2 g4 e4 |
lead LB3 = o5 l8 e2 g4 e4 | d4.< b g4 b4 |
lead LB4 = o4 l8 a4 >c4 e4 c4< | b2 f+4 d+4 |
bass BB1 = o2 l4 c g c g | g d g d |
bass BB2 = o2 l4 d a d a | e b e b |
bass BB4 = o2 l4 a e a e | b f+ b f+ |
chord CB1 = o3 [e g >c]1 | [d g b]1 |
chord CB4 = o3 [e a >c]1 | [d+ f+ b]1 |
drum DB = k4 h4 s4 h4 | k4 h4 s4 h8 h8 |
drum DB4 = k4 h4 s4 h4 | s16 s16 s16 s16 s8 s8 T8 T8 t4 |

order LI1 BI1 CI1 DI1
order LI2 BI2 CI2 DI2
order LA1 BA1 CA1 DA          ; 2: the loop comes back here
order LA2 BA2 CA2 DA
order LA3 BA1 CA1 DA
order LA4 BA4 CA4 DA4
order LB1 BB1 CB1 DB
order LB2 BB2 CA2 DB
order LB3 BB1 CB1 DB
order LB4 BB4 CB4 DB4
loop 2
